cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the software release below and the accompanying paper."
type: software
title: "Gamma recovery and re-analysis from archived VMAT verification report PDFs"
abstract: "Batch tool that recovers measured and planned dose maps from archived myQA verification report PDFs by inverting the embedded colour-scale images, registers the Eclipse DICOM RT Dose export onto the display grid, downsamples the measured map to the MatriXX 32x32 detector grid, and re-computes gamma along eight pathways (recovered TPS dose and DCM, each at native, block-averaged and aperture-smoothed sampling, plus the TPS self-consistency and reversed-reference controls)."
authors:
  - family-names: "Xin"
    given-names: "Siyu"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-22"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24441874
repository-code: https://github.com/syxinsyxin/gamma-recovery-report-pdf
license: MIT
keywords:
  - volumetric modulated arc therapy
  - patient-specific dose verification
  - gamma analysis
  - dose recovery
  - DICOM RT Dose
  - quality assurance
